    "description": "This style of swordplay uses wit and force of personality to increase accuracy, taunting and distracting an opponent with feints, misdirection, and deception. When using a light melee weapon or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> that you are proficient with, you can use your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier instead of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> modifier on attack rolls.<hr /><p><i>Homebrew (tovec.wikidot.com/episode-vii):</i> This talent now applies to both attack AND damage rolls (not attack-only), and is selected as a per-attack toggle rather than automatic.</p>",
